    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space, as you never imagined it, is in danger! Hoards of alien spaceships have invaded in an attempt to control the universe! Take control of the Warp Commander and fight against waves of enemy spaceships as they attempt to carry out their evil plans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game the Warp Commander must use their superior mobility and weapons to fend off up to 15 waves of the alien onslaught! If you are successful in this endeavor, then you might even get a chance to place your name on the list of heros!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the style of a top-down retro arcade arena shooter. The player must dodge and destroy enemies and asteroids in a semi-endless arena to achieve the high score.</p>",
